@startuml
title Coupler: Feature Envy -- AFTER (Refactored)

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #D4EDDA
skinparam ClassBorderColor #28A745
skinparam ClassFontSize 13
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 12

note "REFACTORED: Move Method\nto the class whose data it uses" as N1 #69DB7C

class Order <<Clean Code>> {
  - customer : Customer
  - items : List<Item>
  --
  + getCustomerReport() : String
  .. <color:#28A745>return customer.getReport()</color> ..
}

class Customer <<Clean Code>> {
  - name : String
  - address : Address
  - memberSince : Date
  - loyaltyTier : String
  - orderCount : int
  --
  + **getReport() : String**
  .. <color:#28A745>Uses own data directly:</color> ..
  .. <color:#28A745>name, address.format(),</color> ..
  .. <color:#28A745>memberSince, loyaltyTier,</color> ..
  .. <color:#28A745>orderCount</color> ..
}

Order --> Customer : <color:#28A745>single delegate call</color>

N1 .. Customer

note bottom of Customer
  <color:#28A745><b>Benefits:</b></color>
  - Method lives with the data it uses
  - No more Feature Envy
  - Better encapsulation
  - Less coupling between classes
end note

@enduml
